// HONEST NAME: This is σ (sigma), a smooth suppression function ∈ [0,1].
// Each factor λₖ⁴/(r⁴+λₖ⁴) is a sigmoidal switching function.
// σ → 1 when all |λₖ| >> r, σ → 0 when any |λₖ| << r.
// Uses 4th powers for smooth transition (C³ continuous).
//
// NOT the Kretschner scalar R_μνρσR^μνρσ (which is 48M²/r⁶ for Schwarzschild).
